18:- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives the `UsageMetadata` summed across every provider call in that turn, rather than only the final round's usage ([validated by: reports usage summed across every provider call when a turn runs through two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L53)).
19:- When some rounds in a turn omit `usage`, `afterModelResponse` receives the sum of the rounds that reported it, and when no round in the turn reported `usage`, it receives `undefined` ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage when some omit it, and reports undefined when none did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L63)).

